<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets 6-mth bill auction for Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets 6-mth bill auction for Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish central bank said the Treasury would auction on Tuesday six-month t-bills, after last week's six month t-bill auction on November 12.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : May 21, 1997</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>Auction date: November 19, 1996</p>
<p>Value date  : November 20, 1996</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75 ATA EKS</p>
</text>
